ers":["on them, it’ll just distract from the case at hand. If you have any "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["questions about mine, you can ask later. "]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Asuganameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga2",2,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Yeah… That’s… That’s probably a good idea."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Lyranameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Lyra3",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Uh. That’s all well and good but I feel like there kinda is a secret "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["that already feels pretty relevant."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"ShinkuNametag",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Shinku2",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Huh..?"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Zekenameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Zeke2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Yeah, I mean, I wasn’t gonna *say* anything but if we’re looking for "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["a murderer we probably wanna address the person who killed their mother."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["..."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Asuganameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga2",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["H-huh? Hey! Think about this logically! If she was some cold blooded "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["murderer wouldn’t *that* have been her crime?"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko5",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…No, it’s okay. I should- I should probably explain."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…I’d rather not share, but it really wouldn’t do any good if I didn’t- "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I really don’t want to muddle the case or have people skewed towards "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["thinking I’m the culprit."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Funameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Fu2",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Kid, are you sure?"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",2,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["We already have two bodies on our hands… I feel like this is already "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["going to be complicated as it is, I don’t want to complicate it further."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Lyranameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Lyra2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Then… What exactly is the deal with that whole thing?"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",2,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…I did kill my mother, but I didn’t-... I didn’t mean to-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["My mother died giving birth to me… That’s what they mean by that."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Zekenameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Zeke2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Oh, well, that’s not bad at all. I don’t know why anyone would give a "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["shit about that."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Ismenenameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Ismene",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Well, she could be lying. It’s an easy cover-up."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",2,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I-I’m really not, I promise!"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It’s just… It’s something I’ve carried with me my whole life."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko5",3,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I saw the way Sachi and my dad looked at me and-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["They didn’t say it outloud, how could they? But… But it always felt "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["like they blamed me-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…They would sometimes just look at me and I could just… I could tell "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["what they were thinking-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…I could tell they wished my mom was alive instead of me."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Sometimes it felt like… Things would have been a lot easier if I…"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…If I was never born at all."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"ShinkuNametag",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Shinku2",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["..."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Ismenenameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Ismene3",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["..."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Funameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Fu2",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Kid…"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Asuganameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga2",7,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Kiko…-"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",2,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I’m… I’m sorry, I hope that-... I hope that clears things up. We- we "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["should probably go to the trial now…"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Asuganameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga2",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Kiko… Don’t apologise."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga2",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It just… It breaks my heart everytime I hear you say that about yourself- "]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga4",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…’Cuz… Your life is so, so unbelievably valuable Kiko… Everyone’s is."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga4",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…No one should ever feel like they don’t have a right to live. No "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["one at all."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Stop… Stop comforting me- please…"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Asuganameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Huh..? Is…-"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",2,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It’s not… It’s not fair on you, not at all I-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I’m… I’m so, so sorry Sugi… You’ve just- you’ve just lost-... "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I… I can’t imagine what you’re going through, I-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I didn’t-... I’m–"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I-I should be the one comforting you right now-!"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko2",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I’m just… I’m just being selfish, I… I shouldn’t be getting emotional "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["about this, I’m sorry-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…I’m just… I’m so sorry all of this is happening. I’m sorry he’s gone, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I… I– him and Molly, it’s-"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Asuganameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It’s… It’s a lot, isn’t it?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga2",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…I… I really don’t know how I’m keeping it all together, honestly-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga4",4,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But… We need to figure this out, for both of them… I know that "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["for sure."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["And… And even if it hurts a lot right now, even if… Even if I can’t "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["imagine a world without him… Even if I’m only holding on by telling "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["myself that by some miracle I’ll see him again and he’ll be okay-"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga3",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…At least at the end of this all, we’ll still have each other. If "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["nothing else, that gives me strength."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Asuga4",1,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["No… No matter what happens, this game hasn’t taken everything yet."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Takikonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Takiko2",5,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Sugi…"]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[10]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](I wasn’t entirely sure to trust Takiko on what she said her "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["secret meant… But seeing how close this all hit to home, it was "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["becoming more believable.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](Still, I hardly had time to deliberate on it further before we "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["were interrupted.)"]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"mononekonameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Mononeko",7,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Yes, yes, all very touching and all that- but we do have a trial to "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["get to, in case you forgot. "]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"Ismenenameplate",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["Ismene",6,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Right. We should get to that."]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[10]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](Very few words were exchanged between us as we entered the warden’s "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["office, despite having only done it once before it had started to become "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["routine.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](...Although, for some reason I felt like I was slowly approaching "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["my coffin this time- the air felt suffocating.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](I both wanted nothing more than to just go to that awful trial "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["room and get it all over with… But the idea of even being in there "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["made me nauseous, I wanted time to stand still.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](All I knew is I did not want to talk to her right now.)"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["\\c[6](But as expected-)"]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[198,198,0]},{"code":201,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,93,9,13,8,0]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":3,"walkAnime":true}],"x":0,"y":0},
